      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aguripa yaagambira Paulo ati: Noikirizibwa kwetonganira. Paulo yaimutsya omukono, yaayetonganira naagira ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakusinga Aguripa, naahiirwa ahakuba ebi naatabaariziibwe Abayudaaya byona niiwe naaza kubitonganaho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi okukira munonga ahabw'okuba noomanyira kimwe emicwe yoona n'empaka zoona eby'Abayudaaya; n'ahabw'ekyo ninkweshengyereza ogumisirize ompurire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwiha omu buto bwangye emicwe yangye, ei naakuriiremu omu ihanga ryaitu na Yerusaalemu, Abayudaaya boona nibagimanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fil 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okuruga ira nibammanya, ku baakuba nibaikiriza kugamba, bakaahamya ku naabaire ndi Omufarisaayo ow'omu kicweka ekirikukira ebindi okuhitsya emigyenzo y'ediini yaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu nyemereire aha kucwerwa orubanja ahabw'amatsiko ag'eki Ruhanga yaaraganiise baatatenkuriitwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'enganda zaitu ikumi na ibiri, ezirikwezirika kuheereza Ruhanga nyomushana na nyekiro, nazo nikyo zitegyereize kuhikaho. Kandi naanye, ahabw'amatsiko ago, nikyo ntabaaririziibwe Abayudaaya, Nyakusinga Aguripa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'enki ekirikubateekateekyesa ekigambo eki ku kitarikubaasika Ruhanga kuzoora abafiire?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
